# Tienda de Ciudad Nodo (interior, Mart): the shopkeeper behind the counter. First visit = the parcel errand (
# Parcel): he hands over the parcel for Profesora Lin (give_item parcel, flag parcel_given); the shop stays closed to you until Lin
# has it (flag parcel_delivered, set in villa_lab.map); then `shop ciudad_nodo` (assets/data/shops.toml). column = i, row = j.
@map tienda
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@flag parcel_given 40
@flag parcel_delivered 41
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  C  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  y  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  q  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  K  object=counter
  E  object=shelf
  V  npc=tendero id=clerk face=SW script=clerk
  m  tile=mat
@grid
  Cwywwwyww
  |.EEE.EE.
  |...V....
  |.KKK....
  |.......E
  |........
  |...mm...
@warp m -> ciudad_nodo spawn=tienda_door
@script clerk npc
    jf parcel_delivered open
    jf parcel_given wait
    ask nodo.shop.ask
    jv 0 1 yes
    say nodo.shop.no
    end
  yes:
    give_item parcel 1
    jv 0 0 full
    say nodo.shop.got
    setf parcel_given
    say nodo.shop.thanks
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
    end
  wait:
    say nodo.shop.wait
    end
  open:
    shop ciudad_nodo
@end
